            <article class="aeolus-card">
              <h3>02 · CO₂ stream</h3>
              <p>
                Backup-generator exhaust would be routed through proposed
                treatment equipment before entering the biological system.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="aeolus-card">
              <h3>03 · Photobioreactor</h3>
              <p>
