        <article class="process-step card">
          <strong>01</strong>

          <h3>Condition</h3>

          <p>
            A closed heat-exchange system would establish an appropriate
            temperature before water enters the photobioreactor.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="process-step card">
          <strong>02</strong>

          <h3>Grow</h3>

          <p>
            Warm water and treated CO₂ would enter the enclosed algae
            environment to support controlled microalgae growth.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="process-step card">
          <strong>03</strong>

          <h3>Harvest</h3>

          <p>
            The proposed harvesting system uses electric pulses, bubbles
            and surface skimming to concentrate algae into collectible
            material.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


